{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40019","headline":"鹧鸪 · 徐夤","name":"鹧鸪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣仆梅兼羽翼全，楚鸡非瑞莫争先。\n啼归明月落边树，飞入百花深处烟。\n避烧几曾遗远岫，引雏时见饮晴川。\n茘枝初熟无人际，啄破红苞坠野田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}